docs {
  functions-payments: CreatePayout — run `npm run functions:payments` first
  (port 8093, the only function in this codebase, so no per-function port
  table needed). Always responds 501 PAYMENTS_NOT_YET_BUILT — see
  services/payments/TODO.md and ARCHITECTURE.md v2 §5. Proves the
  core-to-payments call/deploy contract exists without any real Stripe
  integration.
